  "notes": "Public evaluation/deployment scripts accompany an ungated Hub release with JSON/JSONL metadata and 100 application ZIP files. The ZIP count is an artifact inventory, not an asserted test-case or defect count. The documented baseline uses Claude Agent SDK and a pinned Playwright MCP version with external model credentials; these were not installed or run. Code and data Apache-2.0 declarations are retained separately.",
